E0204: `notes:` is not a key Ply knows. The keys an external accepts are: `note`. Did you mean `note`? A key Ply does not know is almost always a typo, and a typo has to be caught rather than ignored (§5.1a rule 1) -- an ignored key is a contract you think you wrote and Ply never read. Found at `externals.venue.notes` in ply.yaml.
